  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Champions Guild Automation:</em> Your soul trinkets are this feature's uses (2, 3 at level 13, 4 at 17; a Long Rest brings you back up to two). <strong>Life Essence:</strong> while you have one, Advantage on death saves and CON saves (the module switches it on and off). <strong>Death's Knell:</strong> when Wails from the Grave has no uses left, the module offers to destroy a trinket instead. When a creature you can see within 30 ft dies, the module offers your Reaction to gain a trinket. Spirit Query is by hand.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
